#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1365 expect=noViolation domain=SUPPDM
#note "SUPPDM carries ordinary, non-population-flag qualifiers -> no violation. Row 2's 'COMPLTFL' is a near-miss on purpose: it is not one of the twelve listed names ('COMPLFL' and 'COMPLT' are). Adapted verbatim from FDA-SD1365."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset SUPPDM label="Supplemental Qualifiers for DM"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col RDOMAIN  type=Char label="Related Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col IDVAR    type=Char label="Identifying Variable"
col IDVARVAL type=Char label="Identifying Variable Value"
col QNAM     type=Char label="Qualifier Variable Name"
col QLABEL   type=Char label="Qualifier Variable Label"
col QVAL     type=Char label="Data Value"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | DM | 01-701-1015 |  |  | RACEOTH | Race, Other        | ASIAN-INDIAN
CDISCPILOT01 | DM | 01-701-1023 |  |  | COMPLTFL | Completer Sub-Flag | N
